<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam inflation unchanged at 2.9 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Vietnam inflation unchanged at 2.9 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's General Statistics Office</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicators on Friday:</p>
<p>    VIETNAM CONSUMER PRICES:	  Oct 96    Sept 96    Oct 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month percentage change    +0.1	 +0.3	+0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year percentage change	+2.9	 +2.9     +15.6</p>
<p> Index base (base 100 = prev. Dec)  102.6	102.5     112.3</p>
</text>
